license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - AI runtime evidence
  - control delivery
  - execution evidence
  - observed effects
  - reproducibility
  - AIREP
abstract: >-
  A reproducible author-side study separating control request, receipt,
  execution and observed effect claims. It combines a frozen synthetic
  ACK-promotion comparison with an offline AIREP v0.2.0-beta.1 reference and
  LangGraph runtime packet. It does not establish external interoperability,
  production safety, adoption or standards endorsement.
